    "body": "I've started preliminary work on my branch [here](https://github.com/chipbuster/starship/tree/extract-presets), but I'm hitting an issue where vuepress doesn't know to deploy the TOML files into the generated directory, meaning that the generated page has the TOML files inline, but it's still not possible to link to them.\r\n\r\nIf anyone knows how to convince Vuepress to deploy these files to the right location, I'd be much obliged. None of the solutions proposed at https://github.com/vuejs/vuepress/issues/700 seem to work.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
