    "updated_at": "2022-02-17T07:15:48Z",
    "body": "I wasn't intending them to be standalone files on the website, though that certainly doesn't hurt, my intention had been to be able to just grab them out of the source repo. Also note the bit about adding them to the `Cargo.toml` `include` field so they end up in the published crate. `cargo` won't know what to do with them but that would let me build from the published crate instead of the repo and still have access to the preset files.",
